{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>林明禎前幾年是廣告及電影商寵兒，憑著可愛性感形象加上半鹹淡廣東話吸引不少人支持，賺到豬籠入水。不過自從與呂爵安（Edan）傳拍拖後，似乎流失了不少粉絲，還惹來了一些haters。林明禎日前度過了36歲生日，她飛往意大利慶祝，穿著超透薄貼身小背心與牛仔褲在街頭拍片，片中見她心情大靚非常風騷，穿梭橫街窄巷又彈又跳，展露玲瓏浮凸身材及曲線美。</p><figure><img alt=\"林明禎日前度過了36歲生日，她飛往意大利慶祝，穿著超透薄貼身小背心與牛仔褲在街頭拍片。（IG@minchen333）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139308493959073792201685.png/fx5HpKQUxn25rmSJDWTuKLjZaRsXbKsUPft26j37duo\"/><figcaption>林明禎日前度過了36歲生日，她飛往意大利慶祝，穿著超透薄貼身小背心與牛仔褲在街頭拍片。（IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"背心非常貼身。（IG@minchen333）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139308499915247616431096.png/IKHeYXbehoEVn1yd9wyQ3YFOV2zmbnrhRfwIMEX8CDA\"/><figcaption>背心非常貼身。（IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"明禎狂擺靚甫士。（IG@minchen333）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139308496987492352187394.png/4vwCR4JHbEWbWA4-4OmGo0V07AGEUe9uaaKUyWmilMk\"/><figcaption>明禎狂擺靚甫士。（IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"轉身望向鏡頭。（IG@minchen333）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139308490569945088709382.png/8iabcrAhvXSxy56FMKkTrLFgvDR5SiJDCNjTiwjY04s\"/><figcaption>轉身望向鏡頭。（IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"又彈又跳！（IG@minchen333）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139308487155650560049158.png/Lrr_Smw7G18aPAXyAeQIGiBRllmW3mEPrDbseqw27Ho\"/><figcaption>又彈又跳！（IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"她心情大靚非常風騷，穿梭橫街窄巷又彈又跳。（IG@minchen333）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139308501152567296983250.png/I-YmqiFkbfPJngdJd1ekq4SbMJ3rTu2pCtGargrRmq4\"/><figcaption>她心情大靚非常風騷，穿梭橫街窄巷又彈又跳。（IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"展露玲瓏浮凸身材及曲線美。（IG@minchen333）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139308497910239232201543.png/P6ANybmWloHy3l2DbGqm3hNmVq8Ytc32e5zci3uc3Is\"/><figcaption>展露玲瓏浮凸身材及曲線美。（IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"明禎身上完全沒有半點贅肉。（IG@minchen333）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139308490926460928546973.png/UQOeYN4GoB_X7A15Z5dhTfQmkkmyaLU3EBx8DBAcfAw\"/><figcaption>明禎身上完全沒有半點贅肉。（IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure><p>不過有部份網民就批評她「扭身扭勢」、造作、姣、假等等，幸好也有一堆網民留言力撐：「講真我有佢咁嘅身材我都會係咁扭身扭勢」、「我係女有咁嘅身材何止扭身扭勢，我做湯瑪斯盤旋添呀」、「唔該女人唔好攻擊女人啦好嗎 啲酸臭味出晒嚟」而林明禎相隔幾日就以簡單16字反擊酸民：「你們繼續酸酸 我繼續發光💫哇哈哈哈哈」展示強大心理質素！</p><figure><img alt=\"不過就有網民留言批評林明禎。（IG@minchen333）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139308494374309888564712.png/bo8isTxDOl5ssmOOHn74jLb6K7LhiR4pZGhr6WRoa-k\"/><figcaption>不過就有網民留言批評林明禎。（IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有網民留言批評林明禎。（Threads@minchen333）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139313858117373952567084.jpeg/L9pPWpTWlwQn4XokR_3tDaVJ8WxuC7O_OeDT6zng0-s\"/><figcaption>有網民留言批評林明禎。（Threads@minchen333）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"但亦有人為她抱不平，並表示支持。（Threads@minchen333）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139313855638409216985126.jpeg/htQSCzTCscuRJyiG77RHTumPgZEBSU9XGCkVFhgpFRY\"/><figcaption>但亦有人為她抱不平，並表示支持。（Threads@minchen333）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林明禎事隔兩日回覆網民：「你們繼續酸酸 我繼續發光💫哇哈哈哈哈」（Threads@minchen333）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139313853247524864270598.jpeg/9IfhEtmo9NpWBDHg9gGEwnit343kmxhDLj4fIS4-HyE\"/><figcaption>林明禎事隔兩日回覆網民：「你們繼續酸酸 我繼續發光💫哇哈哈哈哈」（Threads@minchen333）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林明禎心理質素強大。（IG@minchen333）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139308487608635392482501.png/dZ0tTsGZGrAOXVut26mGTbk4dho-S78HvLySF7y8khc\"/><figcaption>林明禎心理質素強大。（IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-05T07:24:07.536708+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":753,"images":13,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}